<template><style>#captions-es .caption{opacity:0}</style><div data-hf-id="hf-x94b" id="captions-es" data-composition-id="captions-es" data-width="1080" data-height="1920" data-duration="24.7" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%"><div data-hf-id="hf-8ui7" id="cap-1" class="clip caption" data-start="0.170000000" data-duration="1.960000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-3ep2">Hay un pequeño problema con decir que</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-fww9" id="cap-2" class="clip caption" data-start="2.130000000" data-duration="1.505000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-r1tr">tu ventaja competitiva es la IA.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-lmnv" id="cap-3" class="clip caption" data-start="3.875000000" data-duration="1.840000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-gu67">Tu competencia también tiene</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-uq0f" id="cap-4" class="clip caption" data-start="5.715000000" data-duration="1.745000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-bq0d">ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini,</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-cj8s" id="cap-5" class="clip caption" data-start="7.525000000" data-duration="2.615000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-sq4d">probablemente las mismas herramientas que tú.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-98qb" id="cap-6" class="clip caption" data-start="10.265000000" data-duration="1.260000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-m66t">Entonces la diferencia no puede</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-q2ws" id="cap-7" class="clip caption" data-start="11.525000000" data-duration="1.905000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-tz65">ser solamente tener acceso,</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-9aqj" id="cap-8" class="clip caption" data-start="13.495000000" data-duration="2.625000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-qk0o">la diferencia está en qué información tienes</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-xlr2" id="cap-9" class="clip caption" data-start="16.245000000" data-duration="1.965000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-lypy">y qué has aprendido utilizándolas.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-9w9v" id="cap-10" class="clip caption" data-start="18.272000000" data-duration="1.780000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-2vlv">La herramienta se comparte.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-mj96" id="cap-11" class="clip caption" data-start="20.052000000" data-duration="1.965000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-eerv">El aprendizaje acumulado no.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-4kqv" id="cap-12" class="clip caption" data-start="22.041000000" data-duration="1.110000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-9ak9">¿Qué sabe hoy tu negocio</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-alh9" id="cap-13" class="clip caption" data-start="23.151000000" data-duration="1.495000000" data-track-index="8" data-track-kind="captions"><p data-hf-id="hf-pwok">que tu competencia no sabe?</p></div></div><script>const tl=gsap.timeline({paused:true});tl.set("#cap-1",{opacity:1},0.170000000);tl.set("#cap-1",{opacity:0},2.130000000);tl.set("#cap-2",{opacity:1},2.130000000);tl.set("#cap-2",{opacity:0},3.635000000);tl.set("#cap-3",{opacity:1},3.875000000);tl.set("#cap-3",{opacity:0},5.715000000);tl.set("#cap-4",{opacity:1},5.715000000);tl.set("#cap-4",{opacity:0},7.460000000);tl.set("#cap-5",{opacity:1},7.525000000);tl.set("#cap-5",{opacity:0},10.140000000);tl.set("#cap-6",{opacity:1},10.265000000);tl.set("#cap-6",{opacity:0},11.525000000);tl.set("#cap-7",{opacity:1},11.525000000);tl.set("#cap-7",{opacity:0},13.430000000);tl.set("#cap-8",{opacity:1},13.495000000);tl.set("#cap-8",{opacity:0},16.120000000);tl.set("#cap-9",{opacity:1},16.245000000);tl.set("#cap-9",{opacity:0},18.210000000);tl.set("#cap-10",{opaci